@meeting stormLanternBrennan.asked
// EW2 (events writer 2), the ion storm story A: Brennan at the lantern supper, the .asked version (see .fixed).
title: The lantern supper
from: Chef Auda Brennan
gist: Brennan came to the lantern supper to eat. Lukas cooked it low and slow, the way she said.
== lines
brennan: Low and slow, lid on. He listened. Nobody listens, love.   [laugh]
brennan: Lukas, love. That was a proper supper.   [nod]
